From 7da247a48f8ff155510c4b26277b11e308237a8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 02:19:48 +0545
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): optional/required behaviour for Combobox and
 MasterReferencePicker

- Pickers are optional unless marked `required`; optional ones offer an empty row
- List opens on focus/click; cleared fields bring the options back
- Required fields block Enter while empty and flag the field
- Enter picks the highlighted row once the user typed or moved
- Mark mandatory call sites as required

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UJ94HZyuDogdgkYHhHXKeD
